---

### Step 1: Determine the number of remaining potatoes

The total number of potatoes to cook is 9. He has already cooked 7. Therefore, the number of potatoes left to cook is:

$$
9 - 7 = 2
$$

---

### Step 2: Calculate the time to cook the remaining potatoes

Each potato takes 3 minutes to cook. So, the time required to cook the remaining 2 potatoes is:

$$
2 \times 3 = 6
$$

---

